  "answer": "Analyst contribution: domain-by-domain analysis of social media's impact across communication, politics, mental health, economy, education, and social cohesion. Each domain includes balanced positive/negative effects, remembered evidence labels (all unverified in this run), mechanisms, direction/magnitude, and uncertainty. Evidence is thin/contradictory in mental health and social cohesion; magnitude often unknown. No final verdict provided; building blocks for writer.",
